       name after the dash is which page's wording it uses), then add
       the next. The tiles show in the order listed, so reorder the
       list to reorder the tiles. Title, description, link, button
       label and photo all come from the skin, the same on every page.

       When this list has at least one platform chosen, it is the
       whole section and the Card 1 to Card 6 fields below are
       ignored. Leave the list empty to type the cards by hand.

       Keep the group's Name "Platform" and the dropdown's label
       starting with "Platform": the skin finds them by those words
       when TeamSite drops the IDs. Every ID in this file must be
       different from every other.
       ============================================================ -->
